    "detailed_description": "Join Our Discord!<br><br>Join the Discord community to request a free alpha key and get access to the steam game for free!<br><br><strong>Dive into a Vibrant Universe</strong><br>Welcome to Terra Dentium, a solo developer's homage to classic monster battling games. Explore a pixel-art world filled with diverse and mysterious areas, each teeming with wild creatures to discover and capture. With strategic gameplay and endless possibilities, Terra Dentium offers an immersive experience for both seasoned adventurers and newcomers alike. Dive into this epic journey and uncover the secrets of Terra Dentium!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/66fa16104a3d4c8f1e1dcf8afd6f3f6c.poster.avif?t=1736514398\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/66fa16104a3d4c8f1e1dcf8afd6f3f6c.webm?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/66fa16104a3d4c8f1e1dcf8afd6f3f6c.mp4?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train and Evolve</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/afbdcbaa30a2f66a6ebec38c08977123.poster.avif?t=1736514398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/afbdcbaa30a2f66a6ebec38c08977123.webm?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/afbdcbaa30a2f66a6ebec38c08977123.mp4?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Venture into the wild to battle a diverse array of creatures. Train your companions and watch them evolve into legendary forms, each with unique abilities and appearances.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/904200ce4a325a6992834c6b62af0468.poster.avif?t=1736514398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/904200ce4a325a6992834c6b62af0468.webm?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/904200ce4a325a6992834c6b62af0468.mp4?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Pixelated World</strong></h2>Experience a beautifully crafted pixel world with a modern twist on retro gaming aesthetics. Each pixel breathes life into the rich tapestry of environments you\u2019ll explore.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/d2a3aa87b9fa8f45489f3342a19a914c.poster.avif?t=1736514398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/d2a3aa87b9fa8f45489f3342a19a914c.webm?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/d2a3aa87b9fa8f45489f3342a19a914c.mp4?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Battle Mechanics</strong></h2>Engage in strategic turn-based battles that require foresight and planning. Each creature boasts unique skills that cater to a variety of battle styles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/04ff04ca5ac0a694df23a28568b9d19a.poster.avif?t=1736514398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/04ff04ca5ac0a694df23a28568b9d19a.webm?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/04ff04ca5ac0a694df23a28568b9d19a.mp4?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Adventure and Discover</strong></h2>Unlock new areas by evolving your monsters, revealing hidden paths and even rarer creatures.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/3061c920d355cfdfc1491d68ad48ddfe.poster.avif?t=1736514398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/3061c920d355cfdfc1491d68ad48ddfe.webm?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/3061c920d355cfdfc1491d68ad48ddfe.mp4?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fantasy Elements</strong></h2>Immerse yourself in a storyline that intertwines the destiny of your creatures with the fate of the world. Uncover ancient secrets and meet a cast of characters who will help or hinder your journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro Vibe, Modern Play</strong></h2>While Terra Dentium pays homage to the classics with its visual and thematic elements, it incorporates modern gameplay mechanics and storytelling to deliver a fresh, engaging experience.<br><br>Prepare to lose yourself in the nostalgic world of Terra Dentium, where your strategic skills will determine the fate of your creatures and the adventures you embark on. Are you ready to clash, capture, and create your legacy?",
    "about_the_game": "Join Our Discord!<br><br>Join the Discord community to request a free alpha key and get access to the steam game for free!<br><br><strong>Dive into a Vibrant Universe</strong><br>Welcome to Terra Dentium, a solo developer's homage to classic monster battling games. Explore a pixel-art world filled with diverse and mysterious areas, each teeming with wild creatures to discover and capture. With strategic gameplay and endless possibilities, Terra Dentium offers an immersive experience for both seasoned adventurers and newcomers alike. Dive into this epic journey and uncover the secrets of Terra Dentium!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/66fa16104a3d4c8f1e1dcf8afd6f3f6c.poster.avif?t=1736514398\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/66fa16104a3d4c8f1e1dcf8afd6f3f6c.webm?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/66fa16104a3d4c8f1e1dcf8afd6f3f6c.mp4?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Train and Evolve</strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/afbdcbaa30a2f66a6ebec38c08977123.poster.avif?t=1736514398\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/afbdcbaa30a2f66a6ebec38c08977123.webm?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2946450/extras/afbdcbaa30a2f66a6ebec38c08977123.mp4?t=1736514398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Venture into the wild to battle a diverse array of creatures. Train